{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>And a cloud heavy on the mountain.</b> It was alone, and likewise the sounds and the flashes." "<b>And a very strong sound.</b> More than all the shofar sound that they heard." "<b>And all the people who were in the camp trembled.</b> On account of the shofar sound."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:35:54.377894180Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}